filter/1,0,0                                                                    
FILTER:Use internal epsilonl value =   0.384592537277E-12                       
FILTER:Dudding duplicate points:           0                                    
geniee                                                                          
finish                                                                          
cmo/DELATT/mohex/xradavg                                                        
finish                                                                          
